{"id": "11f4cd3a-ae34-414b-8ef9-9ce845366659", "slug": "studio-veda-spatial-design-1", "title": "Studio Veda - Spatial Design", "description": "Studio Veda Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Studio Veda - Spatial Design\"\ndescription: \"Studio Veda Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#B8754F\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#9B5F3F\"\n  background: \"#000000\"\n  surface: \"#191C21\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#756B61\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Instrument Serif\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"10px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Studio Veda - Spatial Design\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Samnang Aing (@samnang). Views: 197; favorites: 10; remixes: 4.\nTags: hero, section, animated, cta, effect.\n## Overview\nStudio Veda Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.\n\nHome Projects Gallery Our People Journal V Studio Veda Book Consult Craft An Authentic Living Space To Experience Timeless Architectural Poetics Thoughtful atmospheres, raw materials, and welcoming layouts designed for…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Craft An Authentic Living Space To Experience; Timeless Architectural Poetics.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #B8754F, secondary #000000, accent #9B5F3F, background #000000, surface #191C21, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Instrument Serif for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Studio Veda - Spatial Design</title>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link\n    href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\"\n    rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body\n  style=\"--stone: #f6f0e8; --ivory: #fffaf3; --espresso: #302821; --espresso-soft: #47382e; --copper: #b8754f; --copper-dark: #9b5f3f; --taupe: #ded1c3; --muted: #756b61; --corner-size: 2rem; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\"\n  class=\"min-h-screen bg-[var(--stone)] text-[var(--espresso)] antialiased selection:bg-[var(--espresso)] selection:text-white\">\n\n  <!-- Header Navigation -->\n  <header\n    class=\"sticky top-0 bg-[var(--stone)]/92 backdrop-blur-xl py-4 px-6 md:px-10 flex justify-between items-center relative z-50 shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)]\">\n    <nav class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm text-[var(--muted)]\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-[var(--espresso)] border-b border-[var(--copper)] pb-1\">Home</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[var(--espresso)] transition pb-1\">Projects</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[var(--espresso)] transition pb-1\">Gallery</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[var(--espresso)] transition pb-1\">Our People</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[var(--espresso)] transition pb-1\">Journal</a>\n    </nav>\n\n    <a href=\"#\"\n      class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 text-3xl text-[var(--espresso)] font-['Instrument_Serif',serif] tracking-tight absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2\">\n      <div\n        class=\"relative w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--copper)] border border-[var(--copper)] rounded-[10px] rounded-tl-[18px]\">\n        <span class=\"text-[1.35rem] leading-none font-light\">V</span>\n      </div>\n      Studio Veda\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-5 ml-auto lg:ml-0\">\n      <button\n        class=\"hidden md:block px-7 py-3 bg-[var(--espresso)] text-white rounded-full text-sm font-light hover:bg-[var(--copper-dark)] transition shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">\n        Book Consult\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main class=\"w-full pb-20\">\n\n    <!-- Hero Typography with Masked Reveal -->\n    <section class=\"text-center mt-20 mb-20 px-4\">\n      <h1\n        class=\"headline-container text-[clamp(3rem,6vw,7rem)] leading-[1.05] font-light tracking-tight flex flex-col items-center gap-2 font-['Instrument_Serif',serif]\">\n        <div class=\"text-[var(--espresso)] flex items-center justify-center flex-wrap gap-x-4 md:gap-x-6\">\n          <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex\"><span class=\"reveal-target block\">Craft</span></span>\n          <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex\"><span class=\"reveal-target block\">An</span></span>\n          <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex\"><span class=\"reveal-target block\">Authentic</span></span>\n\n          <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex rounded-full align-middle\">\n            <span\n              class=\"reveal-target block inline-block w-24 h-[3.5rem] md:w-48 md:h-[5.5rem] rounded-full align-middle shadow-inner border border-[var(--taupe)]\"\n              style=\"background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618220179428-22790b461013?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;\"></span>\n          </span>\n\n          <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex\"><span class=\"reveal-target block\">Living</span></span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"text-[var(--copper)] flex items-center justify-center flex-wrap gap-x-4 md:gap-x-6\">\n          <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex rounded-full align-middle\">\n            <span\n              class=\"reveal-target block inline-block w-24 h-[3.5rem] md:w-48 md:h-[5.5rem] rounded-full align-middle shadow-inner border border-[var(--taupe)]\"\n              style=\"background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618221195710-dd6b41faaea6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;\"></span>\n          </span>\n\n          <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex\"><span class=\"reveal-target block\">Space</span></span>\n          <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex\"><span class=\"reveal-target block\">To</span></span>\n          <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex\"><span class=\"reveal-target block\">Experience</span></span>\n        </div>\n      </h1>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Main Image/Card Section -->\n    <section class=\"px-4 md:px-10 lg:px-12 max-w-[100rem] mx-auto\">\n      <div\n        class=\"relative w-full h-[540px] bg-[var(--espresso)]\"\n        style=\"border-radius: 2.5rem; overflow: hidden; isolation: isolate; transform: translateZ(0); background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(25, 18, 13, 0.82) 0%, rgba(25, 18, 13, 0.60) 34%, rgba(25, 18, 13, 0.18) 66%, rgba(25, 18, 13, 0.08) 100%), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687939-ce8a6c25118c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2200&q=85'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;\">\n\n        <!-- Bottom Left Text Block -->\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-14 left-8 md:left-14 max-w-lg text-white z-10 pr-4\">\n          <h2\n            class=\"text-4xl md:text-[2.75rem] leading-[1.15] font-['Instrument_Serif',serif] font-normal mb-5 tracking-tight\">\n            Timeless Architectural<br>Poetics\n          </h2>\n\n          <p class=\"text-[13px] text-white/80 mb-8 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-[22rem]\">\n            Thoughtful atmospheres, raw materials, and welcoming layouts designed for meaningful daily rituals.\n          </p>\n\n          <button\n            class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-full border border-white/30 flex items-center justify-center text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-[var(--espresso)] transition duration-300\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Overlapping Tab Navigation -->\n        <div\n          class=\"hidden md:block absolute right-0 bottom-0 z-20 bg-[var(--stone)] pt-6 pl-6 pb-6 rounded-tl-[2rem] overflow-visible before:content-[''] before:absolute before:w-8 before:h-8 before:pointer-events-none before:-z-10 before:-left-8 before:bottom-0 before:[background:radial-gradient(circle_at_top_left,transparent_0_2rem,var(--stone)_2.02rem)] after:content-[''] after:absolute after:w-8 after:h-8 after:pointer-events-none after:-z-10 after:right-0 after:-top-8 after:[background:radial-gradient(circle_at_top_left,transparent_0_2rem,var(--stone)_2.02rem)]\">\n\n          <div class=\"relative z-10 flex items-center gap-3 pr-6\">\n\n            <!-- Bedroom -->\n            <button\n              class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full border border-[var(--taupe)] text-[13px] text-[var(--espresso)] hover:border-[var(--copper)] transition bg-[var(--ivory)] shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bed-linear\" class=\"text-[22px] text-[var(--muted)]\"\n                stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n              Bedroom\n            </button>\n\n            <!-- Dining Active -->\n            <button\n              class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--copper)] text-white text-[13px] transition hover:bg-[var(--copper-dark)] shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:armchair-linear\" class=\"text-[22px]\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n              Dining\n            </button>\n\n            <!-- Kitchen -->\n            <button\n              class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full border border-[var(--taupe)] text-[13px] text-[var(--espresso)] hover:border-[var(--copper)] transition bg-[var(--ivory)] shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chef-hat-linear\" class=\"text-[22px] text-[var(--muted)]\"\n                stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n              Kitchen\n            </button>\n\n            <!-- Living -->\n            <button\n              class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full border border-[var(--taupe)] text-[13px] text-[var(--espresso)] hover:border-[var(--copper)] transition bg-[var(--ivory)] shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:sofa-2-linear\" class=\"text-[22px] text-[var(--muted)]\"\n                stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n              Living\n            </button>\n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n      gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n      gsap.from(\".reveal-target\", {\n        yPercent: 120,\n        duration: 1.2,\n        ease: \"power4.out\",\n        stagger: 0.08,\n        scrollTrigger: {\n          trigger: \".headline-container\",\n          start: \"top 85%\",\n        }\n      });\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "studio-veda-spatial-design-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/studio-veda-spatial-design-1.jpg", "source_name": "studio-veda-spatial-design-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 360, "forks": 14, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "66a84ecf-0972-40f3-8a4c-15b11d3aee0a", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T18:03:12.052061+00:00"}